{
	"name": "Strike the Spirit",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/magic/symbols/runes-etched-steel-blade.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>As a bonus action, you may call forth a condemnation of possessor spirits in an attempt to exorcise them. So long as you remain in this stance, you deal additional damage to fiends and undead with the incorporeal trait equal to your Charisma modifier. In addition, if such a spirit is possessing another creature, your attacks on that entity instead strike the possessor spirit and do not harm the possessed creature.</p>",
